\image(figures/retrieval_evaluation.svg)
// result_end
\caption(Top-k hit rate and macro item recall by descriptor set. The two panels use the same query eligibility rule.)
\alttext(Line plots of retrieval hit rate and mean fraction of all relevant items found as the rank cutoff increases.)

High hit rate can coexist with low item recall. A successful first match
counts as a hit even when many other relevant gallery items remain beyond
the cutoff.
